tool_descriptions:
1. search_products
   Input: {"query": "<search query>", "top_k": <int>}
   Finds products relevant to a text query.

2. get_complementary_products
   Input: {"item_ids": ["<item_id>", ...], "top_k": <int>}
   Finds products that can be purchased with the given anchor products.

3. get_substitute_products
   Input: {"item_ids": ["<item_id>", ...], "similarity_threshold": <float>}
   Identifies near-duplicate or interchangeable products from a candidate set.
